If $q(1-\lambda)m\ge1$, then the exponent set satisfies $$\label{eq:row-count}
 \begin{aligned}
 N_K&\le m &&(K\in\mathbb Z),\\
 \#\{K\in\mathbb Z:N_K\ge t\}
 &\le q(m-t+1) &&(1\le t\le m,\ t\in\mathbb Z).
 \end{aligned}$$
